  "summary": "Malicious code in topk-js-darwin-x64 (npm)",
  "details": "This package ships a prebuilt native Node.js addon binary (topk-js.darwin-x64.node, ~5.8 MB) with no accompanying JavaScript source code, no install lifecycle scripts, and no executable bin entries. The binary is opaque to static inspection and may execute arbitrary native code when loaded by Node.js. The package is part of a family of platform-specific binary shards (darwin-x64, darwin-arm64, win32-x64, win32-arm64-msvc, linux-x64, etc.) distributed under the topk-js namespace.",
